cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Hybrid Bias Correction: Values, Distributions, Extremes - with Neural Refinement"
abstract: >
  A reproducible Python framework for daily satellite precipitation bias
  correction. Combines Linear Scaling (mean adjustment), Empirical Quantile
  Mapping with a Generalized Pareto tail (distribution and extreme alignment),
  and a lightweight CNN refinement gated by station-density confidence.
  Operationally tested over Indonesia (2001-2025) on the 0.1 deg IMERG grid.
